TY  - JOUR
TI  - Capivasertib Plus Paclitaxel Versus Placebo Plus Paclitaxel As First-Line Therapy for Metastatic Triple-Negative Breast Cancer: The PAKT Trial
AU  - Schmid, Peter
AU  - Abraham, Jacinta
AB  - PURPOSE: To assess capivasertib added to first-line paclitaxel in metastatic triple-negative breast cancer. METHODS: In this randomized, double-blind, placebo-controlled phase 2 trial, patients with untreated metastatic triple-negative breast cancer received paclitaxel with capivasertib or placebo. RESULTS: Progression-free and overall survival were longer with capivasertib.
