TY  - JOUR
TI  - Capivasertib, an AKT Kinase Inhibitor, as Monotherapy or in Combination with Fulvestrant in Patients with AKT1 E17K-Mutant, ER-Positive Metastatic Breast Cancer
AU  - Smyth, Lillian M.
AU  - Tamura, Kenji
AB  - PURPOSE: To report capivasertib as monotherapy or with fulvestrant in AKT1 E17K-mutant, ER-positive metastatic breast cancer. EXPERIMENTAL DESIGN: Patients were enrolled in a multipart, open-label, non-randomized phase 1 study and received capivasertib alone or with fulvestrant. RESULTS: Capivasertib had clinically meaningful activity in this population.
